@base = http://127.0.0.1:5088
@tenant1 = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@tenant2 = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Tenant selection
GET {{base}}/api/core/tenants

### Tenant 1 local records
GET {{base}}/api/orders?tenantId={{tenant1}}

### Tenant 2 local data
GET {{base}}/api/tenant2/dealers/D001/service-overview?tenantId={{tenant2}}

### Combined dealer overview through HTTP
GET {{base}}/api/tenant1/wrapper/dealers/D001/aftersales-overview?tenantId={{tenant1}}

### Combined repair readiness
GET {{base}}/api/tenant1/wrapper/dealers/D002/repair-readiness?tenantId={{tenant1}}

### Separate claim and warranty results
GET {{base}}/api/tenant1/wrapper/dealers/D003/claims-warranty-summary?tenantId={{tenant1}}

### Missing upstream record: 200, integrationStatus NotFound, Tenant1Data retained
GET {{base}}/api/tenant1/wrapper/dealers/D004/aftersales-overview?tenantId={{tenant1}}

### Wrong tenant: 403
GET {{base}}/api/tenant1/wrapper/dealers/D001/aftersales-overview?tenantId={{tenant2}}

### Wrong tenant for Tenant 2 query: 403
GET {{base}}/api/tenant2/dealers/D001/service-overview?tenantId={{tenant1}}

### Tenant 1 wrapper chatbot
POST {{base}}/api/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"tenantId":"{{tenant1}}","message":"Show combined repairs for D001"}

### Tenant 2 chatbot
POST {{base}}/api/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"tenantId":"{{tenant2}}","message":"Show warranty for D003"}

### Tenant 2 scoped document guidance
POST {{base}}/api/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"tenantId":"{{tenant2}}","message":"Explain warranty workflow"}

### Cross-tenant document: 404
GET {{base}}/api/core/documents/50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002?tenantId={{tenant1}}

### Approved operations
GET {{base}}/api/core/operations?tenantId={{tenant2}}

### Saved Tenant 2 chat sessions
GET {{base}}/api/core/sessions?tenantId={{tenant2}}
